					"content": "怎么样？您帮我问到意见了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250270502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "米卢·努伊"
				},
				{
					"id": 250270502,
					"content": "听到了这样的意见…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						250270503
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 250270503,
					"content": "将顾客的意见告诉了米卢·努伊…",
